2026-07-27T07:45:31.4407213Z [36;1m  fi[0m
2026-07-27T07:45:31.4407538Z [36;1mdone[0m
2026-07-27T07:45:31.4407875Z [36;1mrm -f "$empty_makevars"[0m
2026-07-27T07:45:31.4408361Z [36;1mecho 'MAKEFLAGS = -j2' >> ~/.R/Makevars[0m
2026-07-27T07:45:31.4408909Z [36;1mecho "===== generated ~/.R/Makevars ====="[0m
2026-07-27T07:45:31.4409399Z [36;1mcat ~/.R/Makevars[0m
